| --- | --- | --- |
| 4 | N/A | 280 |
| 3 | N/A | 200 |
| 2 | 75 | 150 |
| 1 | 50 | 75 |
1.	Distances are measured from inside edge of pavement of each driveway or the edge of the intersecting street travel lanes as in Figure 7-5.
2.	Street level refers to the street that vehicles are using to access the site. Level 5 streets do not have driveways.
